    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Good",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "toad"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Volunteer.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 5 on the docket → CR 2 as fighter (masters of martial combat with unparalleled weapon expertise); a scale jerkin and a shield (AC 17), hit points 5d10 + 15. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>The Wardens</strong> — Combat operations, defense, external threats, prisoner management. Leader: Warden Thornshell. The primary fighting force of the Liberated Toads. They handle external threats while the Pond Patrol handles internal order.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Rear guard, level 5.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Combat gear, Defensive armaments, Field supplies (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Combat, Defense, Prisoner escort (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Fighter</strong> — classDefinitions.fighter: Fighting Style (L1); Second Wind (L1); Action Surge (L2); Martial Archetype (L3); Extra Attack (L5)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — strained: Losses from recent engagements; stretched thin</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
